      {
        "text": "The server is Debian",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "ID says ubuntu; ID_LIKE is the family."
      },
      {
        "text": "Debian is installed beside it",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "It is one system."
      },
      {
        "text": "The server should be migrated to Debian",
